	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"62545c547cdb8347",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# $\\ce{Cu^2+}$",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-920,
			"y":860,
			"width":100,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"b71d7fb5833cece6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"$$\\large \\underbrace{\\ce{[Cu(H2O)6]^2+}}_{\\text{(aq) Pale blue solution}} + \\ce{2NH3 ->} \\underbrace{\\ce{[Cu(H2O)4(OH)2]}}_{\\text{(s) Pale blue precipitate}} + \\ce{2NH4^+}$$",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-600,
			"y":1350,
			"width":520,
			"height":100,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"ea6703369744e12f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Deprotonation",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-455,
			"y":1230,
			"width":230,
			"height":60,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{
			"id":"e304828622843f8b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"#  NOT LIGAND EXCHANGE\n\n>[!warning] \n><p class=\"emphasis\">⚠️ THIS IS NOT A LIGAND EXCHANGE REACTION ⚠️</p>\n>\n>![Copper(II) Hexaaqua + Dropwise NaOH|500](copper_ii_hexaaqua_getting_graped.svg)\n>\n>When a few drops of $\\ce{NaOH_{(aq)}}$ or dilute $\\ce{NH_{3}_{(aq)}}$ are added to hexaaquacopper(II), **no $\\ce{Cu - O}$ coordinate bonds are broken**.\n>\n>- **The Mechanism**: The incoming $\\ce{OH-}$ (or $\\ce{NH_{3}}$) acts strictly as a **Brønsted-Lowry base**, accepting protons ($\\ce{H+}$) from two coordinated water molecules.\n>  </br>\n>- **In-situ conversion:** The coordinated $\\ce{H_{2}O}$ ligands are deprotonated directly on the central metal atom to become $\\ce{OH-}$ ligands.\n>  </br>\n>- **The $+2\\text{H}_2\\text{O}$ product:** The water molecules formed on the product side of the $\\text{NaOH}$ reaction are generated by **acid–base neutralisation** ($\\text{H}^+ + \\text{OH}^- \\rightarrow \\text{H}_2\\text{O}$), **not** displaced ligands leaving the coordination sphere!",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-971,
			"y":1520,
			"width":742,
			"height":735,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"1424eab437dfe3e6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"$$\\large \\underbrace{\\ce{[Cu(H2O)6]^2+}}_{\\text{(aq) Pale blue solution}} + \\ce{2OH^- ->} \\underbrace{\\ce{[Cu(H2O)4(OH)2]}}_{\\text{(s) Pale blue precipitate}} + \\ce{2H2O}$$",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1780,
			"y":1130,
			"width":520,
			"height":100,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
